{"supplier":"hotelbeds","supplierHotelId":"712539","name":"Paxton Barcelona","description":"A short walk from Bogatell Beach, Paxton BCN is located in the heart of 22@, Barcelona's Innovation District in Poblenou. Surrounded by bars, restaurants, and art galleries, its modern and relaxed décor invites you to experience a unique blend of French elegance and Mediterranean charm. Whether traveling for business or leisure, Paxton BCN offers an ideal Barcelona base. Savor Mediterranean fusion cuisine at That's Life, our ground-floor restaurant. Enjoy lively conversation in our cozy bar or soak up the sun on our rooftop infinity pool and deck. The hotel's exterior features a unique material that changes color throughout the day, reflecting the surrounding environment. Its dynamic façade shifts from blue to green to gold, creating a vibrant spectacle within the Poblenou neighborhood. Poblenou is a resurgent area, quickly becoming a landmark destination for art, design, technology, and culture. Its seaside location, combined with beaches, promenades, parks, and plazas, contributes to Barcelona's high ranking among the world's most desirable cities, while enjoying fewer tourist crowds. The area's rich history is preserved through the recognition of historic monuments like the Hispania S. A. and Valls, Teixidor I Jordana factories.","address":"Llull, 160","city":"Barcelona","countryCode":"ES","postalCode":"08005","lat":41.3994057,"lng":2.200234,"stars":4,"giataCode":"1288222","phone":"+3493000000","email":"reservations@paxton-bcn.com","images":[{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/71/712539/712539a_hb_a_018.JPG","category":"exterior","order":0},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/71/712539/712539a_hb_a_009.jpeg","category":"exterior","order":1},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/71/712539/712539a_hb_a_010.jpeg","category":"exterior","order":2},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/71/712539/712539a_hb_a_011.jpeg","category